will be less pollution.\""},{"id":"cne_j126_q3","topicId":"cne_j126","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"我来帮你。这是临时决定，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I will helped you."},{"key":"B","text":"I will help you."},{"key":"C","text":"I will to help you."},{"key":"D","text":"I helping you tomorrow now."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"临时决定常用 will。","verify":"\"I will help you.\""},{"id":"cne_j126_q4","topicId":"cne_j126","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"will 的否定式是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"will don't"},{"key":"B","text":"do will not"},{"key":"C","text":"will not"},{"key":"D","text":"not will to"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"will not 可以缩写成 won't。","verify":"\"will not\""},{"id":"cne_j127_q1","topicId":"cne_j127","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问一百年后会有什么，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"What will the world be like in 100 years?"},{"key":"B","text":"What will the world be like 100 years ago?"},{"key":"C","text":"What is the world be like in 100 years?"},{"key":"D","text":"What will the world like in 100 years?"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"in 100 years 表示一百年之后，用 will。","verify":"\"What will the world be like in 100 years?\""},{"id":"cne_j127_q2","topicId":"cne_j127","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"你预测孩子会在家里上课，应怎么说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Kids will studies at home."},{"key":"B","text":"Kids will study at home."},{"key":"C","text":"Kids will study at home yesterday."},{"key":"D","text":"Kids will to study at home."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"will study。","verify":"\"Kids will study at home.\""},{"id":"cne_j127_q3","topicId":"cne_j127","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Do you think there will be more trees? 认为会有，应回答什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Yes, I think not so."},{"key":"B","text":"Yes, there was."},{"key":"C","text":"Yes, I think so."},{"key":"D","text":"No, I think so there will."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"同意这个预测可以说 Yes, I think so。","verify":"\"Yes, I think so.\""},{"id":"cne_j127_q4","topicId":"cne_j127","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说自己不同意，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"No, I am not think so."},{"key":"B","text":"No, I doesn't think so."},{"key":"C","text":"No, I don't thinks so."},{"key":"D","text":"No, I don't think so."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"I don't think so 表示不这么认为。","verify":"\"No, I don't think so.\""},{"id":"cne_j128_q1","topicId":"cne_j128","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"In 50 years, people will have robots at home. There will be less pollution. 家里将会有什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"更多污染"},{"key":"B","text":"机器人"},{"key":"C","text":"纸质书"},{"key":"D","text":"马车"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"will have robots at home。","verify":"\"机器人\""},{"id":"cne_j128_q2","topicId":"cne_j128","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"In 50 years, people will have robots at home. There will be less pollution. 污染会怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"更多"},{"key":"B","text":"和现在完全一样"},{"key":"C","text":"更少"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"less pollution。","verify":"\"更少\""},{"id":"cne_j128_q3","topicId":"cne_j128","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Joe thinks cities will be more crowded. He will live on a space station. 他将住在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"海底"},{"key":"B","text":"乡下"},{"key":"C","text":"学校宿舍"},{"key":"D","text":"太空站"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"live on a space station。","verify":"\"太空站\""},{"id":"cne_j128_q4","topicId":"cne_j128","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Joe thinks cities will be more crowded. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Joe thinks cities will be more crowded."},{"key":"B","text":"Joe thinks there will be no cities."},{"key":"C","text":"Joe will live on a farm."},{"key":"D","text":"People will not have robots."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"cities will be more crowded。","verify":"\"Joe thinks cities will be more crowded.\""}]
